# Locally-measured accepted kernels live here but are NOT tracked.
#
# The variant library is a per-machine measurement record: each leaf carries a
# `// @@variant ... median_us=.. hw_profile=..` provenance header, and a number
# is only meaningful against the board that produced it. Committing them made
# every DKAO PR ~160k lines of generated HIP, so the tree is kept local and the
# repository only carries the layout plus the upstream samples.
#
# A machine that wants the library populates it by running DKAO; the tree is
# staged read-only into generated kernel repositories at runtime.
*
!.gitignore
